+A working prototype of everything below is the scratch worktree `.worktree/proto-c0115`, local branch `proto-c0115`, on c0120's implementation `impl2-c0120` at 757a5fa1 (the measured base, see §11; Implementation step 1 reruns §11 against c0120's landed tree). It has three kinds of commit:
